<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>EU Declaration of Conformity</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 14pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .address-block {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .address-block p {
    margin: 2px 0;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .product-list {
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .product-image-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .product-image {
    width: 100px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .directive-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .directive-list li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .directive-list span {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .signature-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 80px;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .signature-column {
    width: 30%;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .signature-column div {
    height: 50px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 60px;
    right: 60px;
    font-size: 9pt;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div>QSTA 1871 Issue 1</div>
    <div>Date of Issue: <span data-field="issue_date">{{ issue_date }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <h1>ABB</h1>
  <h2>EU Declaration of Conformity</h2>

  <div class="address-block">
    <p>Manufacturer: <span data-field="manufacturer.name">{{ manufacturer.name }}</span></p>
    <p>Address:</p>
    <p><span data-field="manufacturer.address.line1">{{ manufacturer.address.line1 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="manufacturer.address.line2">{{ manufacturer.address.line2 }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="manufacturer.address.city">{{ manufacturer.address.city }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="manufacturer.address.country">{{ manufacturer.address.country }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="product-list">
    <p>This declaration of conformity is issued under the sole responsibility of the manufacturer for the following product(s):</p>
    <p><span data-field="product_list_description">{{ product_list_description }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="product-image-container">
    <!-- Placeholder for product images based on layout -->
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 1" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 2" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 3" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 4" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 5" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 6" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 7" class="product-image">
    <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Product Image 8" class="product-image">
  </div>

  <p>This Declaration is conforming to the requirements of Directive(s) as listed below and complying with the Standard(s) as listed on page 2 of this certificate.</p>

  <ul class="directive-list">
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[0].directive_name">{{ directive_list[0].directive_name }}</span> (ATEX) 2014/34/EU</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[1].directive_name">{{ directive_list[1].directive_name }}</span> (LVD) 2014/35/EU</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[2].directive_name">{{ directive_list[2].directive_name }}</span> (MID) 2014/32/EU</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[3].directive_name">{{ directive_list[3].directive_name }}</span> (EMC) 2014/30/EU</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[4].directive_name">{{ directive_list[4].directive_name }}</span> (RED/RTTE)</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[5].directive_name">{{ directive_list[5].directive_name }}</span> (PED) 2014/68/EU</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[6].directive_name">{{ directive_list[6].directive_name }}</span> (RoHS) 2015/863/EU</li>
    <li><span data-field="directive_list[7].directive_name">{{ directive_list[7].directive_name }}</span> Plastic materials and articles intended to come into contact with food EU 1935/2004, 10/2011 and 2023/2006</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="page">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Model</th>
          <th>Directives & Standards</th>
          <th>Certificate Number</th>
          <th>Test Report</th>
          <th>Issued by:</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[0].model">{{ model_table[0].model }}</span></td>
          <td>PED (Module B + D)</td>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[0].certificate_number">{{ model_table[0].certificate_number }}</span></td>
          <td>Type: Examination Report<br>Report No: <span data-field="model_table[0].test_report.report_no">{{ model_table[0].test_report.report_no }}</span><br>Dated: <span data-field="model_table[0].test_report.date">{{ model_table[0].test_report.date }}</span></td>
          <td>Lloyd's Register<br>Deutschland GmbH<br>NB No: <span data-field="model_table[0].issuer.nb_no">{{ model_table[0].issuer.nb_no }}</span><br>Address: <span data-field="model_table[0].issuer.address">{{ model_table[0].issuer.address }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[1].model">{{ model_table[1].model }}</span></td>
          <td>EN 12516-2:2014a</td>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[1].certificate_number">{{ model_table[1].certificate_number }}</span></td>
          <td>Type: Test Reports in accordance with EN 61010-1<br>Report No: <span data-field="model_table[1].test_report.report_no">{{ model_table[1].test_report.report_no }}</span><br>Dated: <span data-field="model_table[1].test_report.date">{{ model_table[1].test_report.date }}</span></td>
          <td>N/A</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[2].model">{{ model_table[2].model }}</span></td>
          <td>LVD*</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
          <td>Type: Test Reports in accordance with EN 61010-1<br>Report No: <span data-field="model_table[2].test_report.report_no">{{ model_table[2].test_report.report_no }}</span><br>Dated: <span data-field="model_table[2].test_report.date">{{ model_table[2].test_report.date }}</span></td>
          <td>N/A</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[3].model">{{ model_table[3].model }}</span></td>
          <td>EN 61010-1:2011</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
          <td>Type: EMC Test Reports<br>Report No: <span data-field="model_table[3].test_report.report_no">{{ model_table[3].test_report.report_no }}</span><br>Dated: <span data-field="model_table[3].test_report.date">{{ model_table[3].test_report.date }}</span></td>
          <td>N/A</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[4].model">{{ model_table[4].model }}</span></td>
          <td>EMC**</td>
          <td>EN 61326-1:2013<br>EN 61326-2-3: 2013</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="model_table[5].model">{{ model_table[5].model }}</span></td>
          <td>RoHS</td>
          <td>IEC 63000:2018</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
          <td>N/A</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 30px;">* There is no certificate for LVD standard. The test were completed internally and verified by notified body UL to. This declaration covers the compliance to LVD based on the standards the product has been tested and passed to.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt;">** There is no certificate for EMC's standards. The tests were completed internally and by a third-party test house. This declaration covers the compliance to EMC based on the product has been tested and passed to.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt;">*** The total migration and the specific migration are below legal limits if handled properly as described in the specification documentation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page">
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 40px;">This certificate is only valid when the approved product is installed and operated according to the supplied instructions.</p>

    <div class="signature-block">
      <div class="signature-column">
        <div></div>
        <p>Fardowsa Abdulkadir</p>
        <p>Certification Engineer</p>
      </div>
      <div class="signature-column">
        <div></div>
        <p>John Marshall1</p>
        <p>LDL Quality Manager</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div>ABB Limited<br>Oldends Lane, Stonehouse,<br>GL103TA, UK</div>
      <div>DC/FEP610/FEH610/EU-XA Revision I</div>
      <div>Page 3 of 3</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>